Third-party dependencies

The native library requires nlohmann/json (MIT License), resolved at build
time via CMake find_package and not vendored in this repository.

The optional CUDA backend requires the NVIDIA CUDA Toolkit, which is
distributed under its own licence and is neither vendored nor redistributed
here. It is off by default (-DSCL_WITH_CUDA=OFF).

The Python package has no runtime dependencies.
